              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "કમાડ — kamāḍ — \"a wooden door; a door leaf\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "પવનથી ઘરનું જૂનું કમાડ ખખડે છે. pavanthī gharnũ jūnũ kamāḍ khakhḍe che. The old wooden door of the house rattles in the wind."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "A neuter noun."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "કમાડ (kamāḍ) is a tadbhava of Sanskrit kavāṭa, \"the leaf of a door\"; CDIAL lists the Gujarati word, \"a door\" (CDIAL 2963)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
